+/*
+ * Copyright © 2026
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
+ *
+ * Lop tuong thich cho freedreno/drm khi build tren Windows (khong co libdrm,
+ * khong co POSIX). Backend that su tren Windows la d3dkmt/; cac duong DRM
+ * (GEM open/flink/prime, dmabuf, mmap theo fd) chi con la stub tra ve loi.
+ */
